---
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
import { codeTheme, gsapCode, standaloneCode } from '../content/examples';
import HomeHero from '../components/HomeHero.astro';
import IntegrationFeatures from '../components/IntegrationFeatures.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import '../styles/site.css';
import '../styles/homepage.css';
import '../styles/timeline-player.css';
const repo = 'https://github.com/G0m1namm/domfx';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
<meta name="description" content="Give your HTML an expressive edge. Add GPU effects to text, SVGs and images, and sequence them with your GSAP timeline." />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#14151B" />
<meta property="og:title" content="domfx | Effects for real HTML" />
<meta property="og:description" content="Give your HTML an expressive edge. GPU effects for creative developers, with native HTML and GSAP controls." />
<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:image" content="/silver-mark.png" />
<title>domfx | Effects for real HTML</title>
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/CabinetGrotesk-Medium.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
</head>
<body id="top" class="editorial-home">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div class="home-page">
<SiteHeader />
<main id="main">
<HomeHero />
<section class="shader-section" id="integration" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="features-title">
<canvas aria-hidden="true" hidden></canvas>
<div class="integration-lead">
<h2 id="features-title">For creative developers.</h2>
<p>For portfolios, launch pages and interactive stories. Start with one element. Use domfx on its own or bring Fire into your GSAP timeline.</p>
<a class="primary-link" href="/docs/introduction">Explore the docs <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</div>
<div class="shader-motion-row"><span class="shader-status" role="status">Still background</span><button class="shader-motion" type="button" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Animate background</button></div>
</section>
<IntegrationFeatures />
<section class="home-setup" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-title">
<div><h2 id="start-title">Start with one element.</h2><p>Install <code>@domfx/browser</code>, choose a target and attach Fire. Add <code>@domfx/gsap</code> when the effect belongs in a sequence.</p>
<div class="setup-details">
<details id="complete-gsap"><summary>See the complete GSAP setup</summary><p>Create a manual-clock attachment, bind it to your timeline, and dispose both when the element leaves your page.</p><div class="integration-code-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Full manual attachment and GSAP lifecycle example"><Code code={gsapCode} lang="ts" theme={codeTheme} /></div></details>
<details><summary>Use domfx without GSAP</summary><p>The browser package can advance effect time with its own ambient clock.</p><div class="integration-code-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Standalone ambient attachment example"><Code code={standaloneCode} lang="ts" theme={codeTheme} /></div></details>
</div></div>
<div class="setup-action"><div data-effect-host><a id="scroll-target" data-effect-target class="primary-link" href="/docs/installation">Install domfx <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p>WebGPU is required for effects. Reduced motion or unavailable output leaves your original HTML in place.</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/support">Browser support ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/docs/standalone">Standalone example ↗</a></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="editorial-footer">
<div class="footer-meta"><p>GPU effects<br />for real HTML.</p><p>Fire is the first effect.</p></div>
<div class="footer-content"><div class="footer-links"><nav aria-label="Explore"><h2>Explore</h2><a href="#examples">Examples</a><a href="/docs/introduction">Documentation</a><a href={repo}>Source ↗</a></nav><nav aria-label="Resources"><h2>Resources</h2><a href="/docs/gsap">GSAP integration</a><a href="/docs/standalone">Standalone example</a><a href="/docs/support">Browser support</a></nav></div><div class="footer-signature" aria-hidden="true">domfx.</div><div class="footer-end"><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/LICENSE`}>MIT licensed ↗</a><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></div>
</footer></div>
<p class="effect-notice" id="effect-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
<script src="../scripts/site.ts"></script>
<script src="../scripts/homepage.ts"></script>
</body>
</html>
